<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Buffelsfontein Sept qtr net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Buffelsfontein Sept qtr net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  24.64 vs 15.25</p>
<p>    Capital recoupment			1.55  vs 2.10 recoupment</p>
<p>Tonnes milled</p>
<p>	- Underground			 214,000 vs 207,000</p>
<p>	- Surface			     436,000 vs 484,000</p>
<p>Gold output (kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			   1,471 vs  1,377</p>
<p>	- Surface				   430 vs    405</p>
<p>Yield (gram/t)</p>
<p>	- Underground			    6.87 vs 6.65</p>
<p>	- Surface				  0.99 vs 0.84</p>
<p>Cost (rand/kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			  47,789 vs 52,529</p>
<p>	- Surface				24,079 vs 25,119</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			55,198 vs 54,120</p>
<p>Full name: Buffelsfontein Gold Mining Co Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
